window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Santa</b></p> <p>She caught my attention when she shouldn't have. My sweet, little temptation has made it to the top of Santa's naughty list, and rather than a lump of coal, she'll be getting a collar and a prison of my making for Christmas.</p> <p>I'm about to wrap this beautiful, seductive gift up and devour her for the holidays. Who says Santa doesn't deliver your deepest, darkest desires?</p> <p><b>The Gift</b></p> <p>One moment, I was free, living my life and preparing for the misery of the holidays, and the next, a mystery man was messaging me and enticing me with my naughtiest fantasies.</p> <p>All, however, is not what it seems. Rather than a spicy encounter in a darkened room, I find myself a captive for the holidays and kidnapped by a psychopath. The question is, will I still be alive to welcome the new year when he's done with me?</p> <p>Stalking Christmas <i>is a dark stalker, he-falls-first, forced proximity romance. This book is a standalone for mature listeners. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
